<div itemid="wfo-0000952367" itemtype="http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/Taxon" itemscope="itemscope"><div class="page-banner no-print"><div class="page-banner-inner"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="span12"><div class="page-header"><h2 id="page-title"><a href="https://list.worldfloraonline.org/wfo-0000952367"><b class="WFOID">wfo-0000952367</b></a><br/><a href="#feedbackModal" data-toggle="modal" onclick="$('option:contains(Epipremnum aureum (Linden & André) G.S.Bunting)').attr('selected', true); return true;" title="Comment on Epipremnum aureum." data-placement="right" rel="tooltip" class="pull-right"><i class="halflings-icon comments submitComment"></i></a><i class="glyphicons-icon leaf"></i><em itemprop="scientificName" class="taxonName">Epipremnum aureum</em> <span itemprop="scientificNameAuthorship">(Linden & André) G.S.Bunting</span><ul class="unstyled"><p><li><small class="protologueText"><span itemprop="namePublishedIn" id="protologue">Ann. Missouri Bot. Gard.  50: 28 (1964)</span> <span content="Valid" itemprop="nomenclaturalStatus"></span></small></li></p><p><li><small class="taxonomicStatusText"><div id="taxonomicStatus"><section><p>

														This name is reported by <a href="/organisation/Araceae;jsessionid=77182D670E518FC253C54F4F8E68AA47">Araceae</a> as an accepted name
													

													in the genus
													<a href="/taxon/wfo-4000013633;jsessionid=77182D670E518FC253C54F4F8E68AA47">Epipremnum</a>
													(family <a href="/taxon/wfo-7000000042;jsessionid=77182D670E518FC253C54F4F8E68AA47">Araceae</a>).

												</p><p>
											The record derives from <b>WCSP</b>
												(data supplied on 2025-12-15)
											
											which
											
													reports it as an accepted
													name
												(record <a href="http://apps.kew.org/wcsp/namedetail.do?name_id=70476" rel="external">70476</a>)
											</p></section></div></small></li></p></ul></h2></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class="hide print" id="printHeader"><h2 id="page-title"><i class="glyphicons-icon leaf"></i><em>Epipremnum aureum</em> <span>(Linden & André) G.S.Bunting</span><ul class="unstyled"><li><small><span id="protologue">Ann. Missouri Bot. Gard.  50: 28 (1964)</span> <span></span></small></li><li></li></ul></h2></section><div class="container"><header id="overview" class="subhead clearfix"><div class="subnav no-print"><ul class="nav nav-pills"><li><a href="#local">Local Descriptions</a></li><li><a href="#distributionMap">Distribution map</a></li><li><a href="#synonyms">Synonyms</a></li><li><a href="#bibliography">Bibliography</a></li></ul></div></header><script type="text/javascript">
			$(document).ready(function(){
				$('#clickMe').toggle(
						function(){
							$('#textBox').hide();
							$('#clickMe').text('Show details');
